<title>USA: Enron Oil &amp; Gas increases buyback program.</title>
<headline>Enron Oil &amp; Gas increases buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Oil &amp; Gas Co said on Friday it will repurchase up to 5 million of its shares on the open market.</p>
<p>This buyback is a separate effort from the company's ongoing repurchase of up to 1 million shares for its employee stock and stock-option programs.</p>
<p>Enron Oil &amp; Gas shares were trading at 21-1/2 early Friday. The stock's 52-week high was 30-5/8. The company has about 159.7 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Enron Oil &amp; Gas is a majority-owned subsidiary of Enron Corp.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
